  "body": "Call for a private viewing time. \r\nDesigned for effortless family living and entertaining, this exceptional near-new home combines generous spaces, sophisticated style and outstanding outdoor living, complete with a heated in-ground pool that brings a true resort feel to your own backyard.\r\n\r\n*Attention Agents: Bring your buyers - we offer competitive conjunctional rates to all agencies.*\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your forever family home or a premium lock up and leave property, this home delivers an impressive combination of quality, space and lifestyle, featuring:\r\n*\tFour spacious bedrooms and three luxurious bathrooms\r\n*\tNear-new executive home\r\n*\tHeated in-ground pool with resort-style outdoor living\r\n*\tDesigner kitchen with quality finishes and generous butler's pantry\r\n*\tExcellent indoor-outdoor flow for year-round entertaining\r\n*\tBuilt by sought-after local builder Dream Concept Homes\r\n*\tBalance of the Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in one of Millwater's most desirable neighbourhoods, this home offers the ideal balance of relaxed community living and everyday convenience. Orewa Primary School and Orewa College are nearby, along with local cafés, parks, walkways and Millwater Central.\r\n\r\nJust minutes away, Silverdale provides an extensive range of shopping, dining, medical and commercial amenities, while the Orewa Estuary Walkway and Orewa Beach are close at hand for enjoying the best of the Hibiscus Coast lifestyle. With easy motorway access north and south, you're well connected while still enjoying the peace and space Millwater is known for.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a near-new, move-in-ready home with a heated in-ground pool in Millwater are limited. With our Vendors committed to moving, now is the time to act. \r\n\r\nIf you've been thinking about making a move before Christmas, this could be the home you've been waiting for. Secure your new home now and be settled in time to enjoy summer by the pool.\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms may be available.\r\n\r\nContact Sarah today to arrange your private viewing, or come along to one of our advertised open homes.",
